<title>NIGERIA: Delta Glass Nigeria in half-year profit.</title>
<headline>Delta Glass Nigeria in half-year profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Delta Glass Nigeria Plc to end-June, 1996</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p> Turnover		     630.4  vs 684.3</p>
<p> Profit before taxation   135    vs  61.1</p>
<p> Taxation			43.2  vs  41.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Delta Glass, a subsidiary of Nigerian Bottling company (NBOT.LG, manufactures glass containers and table glasswares. ($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
